OL,3,GNEWSAFootage shows Dexter 'kill room'
OL,4,Amurderer's arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have released bodycam footage of
OL,7,Fthe moment a university forensics
OL,8,Fstudent was arrested for murdering a
OL,9,Fwoman after a court heard he had
OL,10,Fstabbed her to death in a "kill room"
OL,11,Fcopied from US TV show Dexter.
OL,13,FThe video shows Benjamin Day, who cut
OL,14,Fopen his hand while attempting to
OL,15,Fdismember the body of Maria Saceanu,
OL,16,Flying to officers after the killing,
OL,17,Fclaiming to have been bitten by a wild
OL,18,Fdog or a fox.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
