OL,3,GNEWSAFootage shows Dexter 'kill room'
OL,4,Amurderer's arrest
OL,5,
OL,6,FDay, 20, changed his plea at
OL,7,FWolverhampton Crown Court on Tuesday to
OL,8,Fadmit to murdering the 24-year-old
OL,9,FRomanian.
OL,11,FA trial heard his victim, who had been
OL,12,Fa sex worker, had been lured to a
OL,13,Fplastic-lined room at an Airbnb in
OL,14,FTividale, in the West Midlands, where
OL,15,Fshe suffered 78 knife wounds.
